@@ -95,6 +95,8 @@ Base Mainnet chain ID is `8453`, Base Sepolia is `84532`. Network support here i
 
 All on-chain calls in this version are read-only. The mock tests demonstrate code behavior only and **do not establish real-world safety or independent security-audit certification**.
 
+The EIP-1193 session rechecks `eth_chainId` **after** each block-header, native-balance, ERC-20 `eth_call`, or contract-code response as well as before starting it. If an RPC provider silently switches networks during a pending read (even without a `chainChanged` event), the session is disconnected and the sampled result is discarded; it does not fall back to another network. `test/read-chain-boundaries.test.js` exercises these failure paths entirely with mock providers. This is a defensive check, not evidence of a completed third-party dApp login.
+
 Related token repositories: [DAT](https://github.com/FordPrefect2026/DAT) · [EMA](https://github.com/FordPrefect2026/EMA-Draft) · [CAWELON](https://github.com/FordPrefect2026/CAWELON-Draft).
 
 **DON'T PANIC. JUST CODE.**
